{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CANARY</strong> is a narrative survival adventure with psychological horror and atmospheric tension<strong> </strong>set<strong> </strong>in a remote winter landscape where the lines between nature and synthetics have begun to blur.<br><br>After a helicopter crash, <strong>13-year-old Chance Rivers</strong> wakes up alone in the snow. His mother is gone. His sister, <strong>Canary</strong>, has vanished. And something in the forest is not what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world controlled by <strong>Praxis Labs</strong>, a corporation obsessed with achieving immortality, and survive the strange effects of <strong>Omnium</strong>, a hallucinogenic biomineral that distorts perception and reality itself.<br><br>Among frozen lakes, silent woods, and the ruins of a secret laboratory buried in the mountains, Chance must survive the winter\u2019s night, the machines that hunt him, and learn to overcome his own creeping doubt as his senses grow ever adjusted to this strange new reality.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127430?t=1762434256","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127430?t=1762434256","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127430/c53a704fa3c03d9eca13d5d40c712ca8690d7313/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762434256","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127430/c53a704fa3c03d9eca13d5d40c712ca8690d7313/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762434256","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CANARY</strong> is a narrative survival adventure with psychological horror and atmospheric tension<strong> </strong>set<strong> </strong>in a 